      "mimeType": "text/html;charset=utf-8",
      "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html class=\"no-js  page-3 app-BLINDFOLD\" lang=\"en\" >\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <title>Tally | APEX Blindfold</title>\n  <base href=\"/ords/\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/i/app_ui/css/Core.css?v=26.2.0\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/i/app_ui/css/Theme-Standard.css?v=26.2.0\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/i/libraries/apex-utility-css/26.2.5/util-base.css?v=26.2.0\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/i/app_ui/css/WebComponents.css?v=26.2.0\" type=\"text/css\" />\n\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/i/libraries/font-apex/2.5.1/css/font-apex.css?v=26.2.0\" type=\"text/css\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/i/themes/theme_42/26.1/css/Core.css?v=26.2.0\" type=\"text/css\" />\n\n  \n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/i/themes/theme_42/26.1/css/Vita-Dark.css?v=26.2.0\" type=\"text/css\" />\n\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"r/blindfold/2620/files/static/v<id>/blindfold/blindfold.css\" type=\"text/css\" />\n\n  \n  <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"r/blindfold/2620/files/static/v<id>/icons/app-icon-192.png\" /><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"r/blindfold/2620/files/static/v<id>/icons/app-icon-32.png\" />\n  \n\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover\" />\n  <meta name=\"app-version\" content=\"0.1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"app-tenant-id\" content=\"\" />\n  <meta name=\"app-alias\" content=\"BLINDFOLD\" />\n  <meta name=\"app-page-alias\" content=\"TALLY\" />\n</head>\n<body class=\"t-PageBody t-PageBody--hideLeft t-PageBody--hideActions t-PageBody--blank no-anim bf-page t-PageBody--contain apex-side-nav apex-icons-fontapex apex-theme-vita-dark\"   id=\"t_PageBody\">\n<noscript class=\"t-PageBody-noScript\">You must run this product with JavaScript enabled</noscript>\n<a href=\"#main\" id=\"t_Body_skipToContent\">Skip to Main Content</a>\n<form role=\"none\" action=\"wwv_flow.accept?p_context=blindfold/tally/<id>\" method=\"post\" name=\"wwv_flow\" id=\"wwvFlowForm\" data-oj-binding-provider=\"none\" novalidate  autocomplete=\"off\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"p_flow_id\" value=\"2620\" id=\"pFlowId\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"p_flow_step_id\" value=\"3\" id=\"pFlowStepId\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"p_instance\" value=\"<id>\" id=\"pInstance\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"p_page_submission_id\" value=\"MTk2NDY5MjA5OTYxNDgwNDc1MjcxNDEzOTc4ODc1NDA3MDQ5MzY5&#x2F;DrizikCXCEbfLNFGxqL81-5Ve9YmiPNEoW8khmnqu58vzcDmP0wG6nBWRSEntbRO1Jf87KgfHX5LV-2RGXxfwA\" id=\"pPageSubmissionId\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"p_request\" value=\"\" id=\"pRequest\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"p_reload_on_submit\" value=\"S\" id=\"pReloadOnSubmit\" /><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"blindfold&#x2F;tally&#x2F;<id>\" id=\"pContext\" /><input type=\"hidden\" value=\"<id>\" id=\"pSalt\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"p_debug\" value=\"LEVEL9\" id=\"pdebug\" />\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"t-Body-contentInner\">\n  <span id=\"APEX_SUCCESS_MESSAGE\" data-template-id=\"<id>_S\" class=\"apex-page-success u-hidden\"></span><span id=\"APEX_ERROR_MESSAGE\" data-template-id=\"<id>_E\" class=\"apex-page-error u-hidden\"></span>\n  <div id=\"R<id>\" class=\"\"  ><div class=\"bf-shell\" data-bf-page=\"authority\">\n  <section class=\"bf-hero\">\n    <p class=\"bf-eyebrow\">Election authority &middot; the private key never leaves this tab</p>\n    <h1 class=\"bf-title\">Tally</h1>\n    <p class=\"bf-lede\">The database adds up votes it cannot read and hands back three encrypted totals. <strong>Only the key in this browser tab turns them into numbers.</strong></p>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"bf-steps\">\n    <section class=\"bf-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"bf-step-key\">\n      <h2 class=\"bf-panel__title\" id=\"bf-step-key\"><span class=\"bf-step\">1</span>Generate the key pair</h2>\n      <p class=\"bf-panel__text\">Two 1024-bit primes are found in this browser. The public key goes to the database. The private key stays in the memory of this tab.</p>\n      <div class=\"bf-inline\">\n        <label class=\"bf-field\">\n          <span class=\"bf-field__label\">Registered voters</span>\n          <input class=\"bf-input bf-input--number\" id=\"bf-voters\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"100000\" value=\"20\">\n        </label>\n        <button class=\"bf-button\" id=\"bf-generate\" type=\"button\">Generate key pair and open election</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"bf-message\" id=\"bf-key-status\" role=\"status\"></p>\n      <div class=\"bf-facts\" id=\"bf-key-facts\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"bf-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"bf-step-tally\">\n      <h2 class=\"bf-panel__title\" id=\"bf-step-tally\"><span class=\"bf-step\">2</span>Ask the database to tally</h2>\n      <p class=\"bf-panel__text\">For each option the database multiplies the stored ciphertexts modulo n&sup2;. The product is a ciphertext of the number of votes.</p>\n      <p class=\"bf-live\" id=\"bf-live\" role=\"status\"></p>\n      <button class=\"bf-button\" id=\"bf-tally\" type=\"button\">Tally encrypted ballots</button>\n      <p class=\"bf-message\" id=\"bf-tally-status\" role=\"status\"></p>\n      <div class=\"bf-totals\" id=\"bf-totals\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"bf-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"bf-step-decrypt\">\n      <h2 class=\"bf-panel__title\" id=\"bf-step-decrypt\"><span class=\"bf-step\">3</span>Decrypt the totals</h2>\n      <p class=\"bf-panel__text\">Three decryptions, in this browser, with the private key. Nothing else is decrypted.</p>\n      <button class=\"bf-button\" id=\"bf-decrypt\" type=\"button\" disabled>Decrypt three totals</button>\n      <p class=\"bf-message\" id=\"bf-decrypt-status\" role=\"status\"></p>\n      <div class=\"bf-results\" id=\"bf-results\"></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div></div>\n</main>\n<div class=\"t-Body-inlineDialogs\" id=\"t_Body_inlineDialogs\"></div>\n<input type=\